      "selector": ".sqs-html-content (index 0)",
      "html": "<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"sqsrte-small\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--black\"><strong>Sahara</strong>: What was once covered by water is now a dry and arid desert. The mysteries of the Sahara are endless. Rumors of a lost city are deep within the adventure community but the ancient ruins of Ubar has still yet to be found. The great desert is a reminder that even oceans have a death. But there is a story in every skeleton.</span></p><p class=\"sqsrte-small\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--black\">24” X 36” Mixed media acrylic painting with organic plaster base layer on gallery wrapped canvas. Ready to hand.</span></p><p class=\"sqsrte-small\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--black\"><strong>Please email me at vudiphothisukart@gmail.com for serious inquiries.</strong></span></p></div>",
